   "p": {},
   "tin": {
    "type": "dissolve",
    "dur": 1.4
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "My very dear Sarah,",
     "start": -2.601,
     "end": -1.1
    },
    {
     "text": "The indications are very strong that we shall move in a few days — perhaps tomorrow.",
     "start": 0.25,
     "end": 5.023
    },
    {
     "text": "Lest I should not be able to write you again, I feel impelled to write lines that may fall under your eye when I shall be no more.",
     "start": 6.073,
     "end": 13.382
    },
    {
     "text": "Sarah, my love for you is deathless. It seems to bind me with mighty cables that nothing but Omnipotence could break.",
     "start": 15.632,
     "end": 22.77
    },
    {
     "text": "If I do not return, my dear Sarah, never forget how much I love you.",
     "start": 24.42,
     "end": 28.934
    },
    {
     "text": "And if there be a soft breeze upon your cheek, it shall be my breath.",
     "start": 30.184,
     "end": 34.669
    },
    {
     "text": "Sarah, do not mourn me dead. Think I am gone, and wait for thee, for we shall meet again.",
     "start": 35.919,
     "end": 41.921
    }
   ]
  },
